The [[toh:tp-link:start|TP-Link]] RE305 is a wall-pluggable dual-band wireless range extender (802.11b/g/n and 802.11a/n/ac) based on the MediaTek SoCs with a Fast Ethernet port. The RE305v3 is based on a MediaTek MT7628AN SoC. The device has 8 MiB flash and 64 MiB ram.


